{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size_claims", "text": "论文指出 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章语料的约 185k 条 claim。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_corpus_size", "text": "FEVER 数据集基于 5.4M 篇维基百科文章的语料构建。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_scale_statement", "text": "该论文引言指出，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，这些 claim 来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_label_categories", "text": "这些 claim 根据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_claims_source_and_fields", "text": "在本文的实验中，FEVER 的 claim 来自维基百科；作者从 FEVER 数据集中收集所有 claim 及其“id”、“label”和“verifiable”字段。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c7c17ddf8a10b59543bbe5cd"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t3", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size_uqa", "text": "Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking 的引言指出，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_size_cnn_none", "text": "提供的《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》摘要证据未涉及 FEVER 数据集，也未给出其规模。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}, {"key": "uqa_performance_numbers", "text": "Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking 报告其在转换后数据集的开发集上标签准确率为 80.2%，在测试集上为 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "uqa_vs_baseline", "text": "该文在“SUPPORTS”标签的标签准确率上与监督方法 HexaF 比较，并称在 φ = 0.76 时其方法可与 HexaF 相比，但未报告具体的提升幅度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "cnn_outperforms_claim", "text": "《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》摘要仅称其方法显著优于基线，未给出具体数值提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文的可比性有限：FEVER 规模仅由 fact-checking 论文报告，临床信息抽取论文未涉及 FEVER；性能方面，前者报告标签准确率数值并与 HexaF 作定性比较，后者仅给出“显著优于基线”的无具体数值结论，二者任务与指标不同。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
